# WP-SCRIPT-API (owner 11-17, World Partition to the end): the Luau library WorldPartition
# (Desert/Desert/Source/Engine/Libraries/WorldPartitionLibrary.hpp) - streamingPending / allStreamingPending (UE
# IsStreamingCompleted / IsAllStreamingCompleted as counts, 0 = complete, no -1 before the first tick),
# waitUntilStreamed (UE's latent wait), cellStatesAt (a cell's GetCurrentState) and the hooks
# OnStreamingStateUpdated(), OnWorldPartitionCellActivated(cell), OnWorldPartitionCellUnloaded(cell)
# (ScriptEngine::DeliverWorldPartitionEvents). A QUERY LOADS NOTHING (UE FWorldPartitionStreamingQuerySource):
# the teleport streams its destination with a Streaming Source there, then waits on the query, then moves.
# World: Scenes/WP_Protocol (WP-PROTOCOL.scn). The scenario adds what it needs: entity 9000103 tagged
# "WPTeleportTarget" at P = (70000, 0, 0) (700 m +X, inside the landscape, beyond the Main grid's 200 m loading
# range) with a disabled Streaming Source, and entity 9000104 running Content/Scripts/World/WPTeleport.lua; both are
# not spatially loaded (UE bIsSpatiallyLoaded = false), so the script and its target exist before P streams in.
# Entity 9000105 is an ordinary spatially loaded box beside P, so a Main cell holds P (unloaded at the start: the
# world itself has no record within 50 m of P) and cellStatesAt(P) has a cell to report.
# Expected (editor.log): "pending before the first tick: N" with N > 0 (never -1); "activated G..." lines for the
# cells around P; "[WorldPartition] streaming completed for query in N ms (Activated)", "teleport after N ms" (the coroutine resumed); then cellStatesAt prints
# "...: Activated" for every cell holding P; "unloaded G..." for the start area afterwards.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Дано wait-idle 2400
Дано set 9000001 StreamingSourceData.Enabled true
Дано set 9000002 StreamingSourceData.Enabled false
Дано spawn Content/Meshes/Modeling/Box.stmesh 70000,0,0 --id 9000103
Дано set 9000103 Tag.Tag "WPTeleportTarget"
Дано set 9000103 WorldPartition.IsSpatiallyLoaded false
Дано add-component 9000103 StreamingSourceData
Дано set 9000103 StreamingSourceData.Enabled false
Дано spawn Content/Meshes/Modeling/Box.stmesh 0,0,0 --id 9000104
Дано set 9000104 WorldPartition.IsSpatiallyLoaded false
Дано add-component 9000104 Script
Дано set 9000104 Script.Scripts '[{"ScriptKey":"assets:Scripts/World/WPTeleport.lua","Props":[]}]'
Дано spawn Content/Meshes/Modeling/Box.stmesh 71000,0,1000 --id 9000105
Когда run Mode "Select mode"
Когда run Action "Play from Here"
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
# Тогда [кадр]: wpapi_teleport_wait - the first frame after the move: the player stands on the ground at P, the cells
# around are real (not HLOD), nothing falls; the log has "streaming completed for query in N ms".
Тогда wpapi_teleport_wait первый кадр после переноса: игрок стоит на земле в P (700 м), вокруг настоящие ячейки (не HLOD), без падения; в логе «streaming completed for query in N ms», «activated G…» для ячеек вокруг P, cellStatesAt(P) — «Activated»
Когда run Action "Stop"
# The second half of the card (a script sets the data layer "Night" Activated and writes "Night: Activated" in the UI
# from OnDataLayerRuntimeStateChanged; frame wpapi_layer_event) needs RUNTIME data layers, which no branch streams
# yet: task/WP-DATA-LAYERS-RUNTIME holds the EDITOR layers only (SceneFormat.hpp DataLayerSerialized). Its lines join
# this file with WorldPartition.setDataLayerRuntimeState / getDataLayerRuntimeState / getDataLayerEffectiveRuntimeState.
